SUMMARY:2026 Fall SMR Family Campout
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\nUpdate: So
 ld out! Accepting Waitlist families only.\n\n### **Starting August 22nd\, 
 registration will be open for the 13th SMR Family Campout on Saturday and 
 Sunday\, September 19th to 20th\, (rain dates\, September 26th to 27th). S
 ponsored by the South Mountain Conserancy with the support of Essex County
  Parks\, this award-winning program caters to families with young children
  ages 4 to 11. With nature-intensive programing\, this overnight program p
 rovides an opportunity for families new to camping or just in love with na
 ture to experience a special experience close. Generally\, this event fill
 s up in 2 to 3 days.**\n\n***DO NOT REGISTER ON MEETUP. GO [HERE](https://
 www.somocon.org/family-campout/2026-fall-smr-family-campout/) for more inf
 ormation and registration instructions.***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/somocon/events/316081419/
