SUMMARY:Lenape-Oakdale Combo w/ Lou Nocito ~ 3 miles
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\n**Saturday
 \, September 26\, 10:00 a.m.– 12:30 p.m.**\n\nLenape Oakdale Combo from 
 Tulip Springs. We will walk the Lenape to the Oakdale which we will hike i
 n its entirety and then back.\n\nMeet at: Tulip Springs\, 0.4 miles north 
 of the light at S. Orange Ave. and Cherry Lane. Make an immediate right tu
 rn after exiting Cherry Lane.\n\nLeader: Lou Nocito\, 973-953-7099\n\n\\*\
